  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Force Unleashed:</strong> Once per scene, <strong>mark a Stress</strong> to unleash your unbound power that lasts until you take Severe damage or the scene ends. While <em>Unleashed</em>, your successful attack rolls gain the following features:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Kinetic Blast:</strong> You can choose to push the target one range band away.</p></li><li><p><strong>Surge:</strong> After rolling damage, you may <strong>spend an Echo</strong> to choose any number of dice and reroll them.</p></li></ul>",
